# #47: an artist's albums from one range of the precompute file. Music ->
# Artists -> five artists (the first, a case variant, a non-ASCII name,
# the '#' group at the end), each list checked against its shot. Every
# "lib open albums" line should say src=slice and cmds=4 (open, header,
# the artist's 8-byte start pair, its records); a stale or missing file
# falls back to src=scan with the same rows. Proposed goldens: the five
# shots, which must match the scan's (pixel-identical at capture).
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p16-artist-open.script
# needs: library
# trace: lib

wait 4000           # boot to the main menu, "Music" selected
wait_db 30000       # database built (shots.sh primes it if missing)

key SELECT          # Music
wait 800
wheel +1            # "Artists"
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800

key SELECT          # The Alder Trio
wait 800
shot alder
key MENU
wait 800

wheel +2 300        # Ångström Lane
wait 1500
key SELECT
wait 800
shot angstrom
key MENU
wait 800

wheel +1 300        # aurora drift (lower case)
wait 1500
key SELECT
wait 800
shot aurora
key MENU
wait 800

wheel +2 300        # The Bellwethers
wait 1500
key SELECT
wait 800
shot bellwethers
key MENU
wait 800

wheel +100 20       # the end of the list: the '#' group
wait 1500
key SELECT
wait 800
shot last
key MENU
wait 800

quit
